  +++ checksec-2.7.1.tar.gz eba0616f4033385d6093608a2a2aad3c2debb847d6778c87346f89c80946684f

  Files identical despite different names
  --- checksec-2.7.1/ChangeLog
  +++ checksec.sh-2.7.1/ChangeLog

